msgid "Set a ``RELAYx_PIN`` to “81” to control the  switching. Then select an RC channel for control (Chx) and set its ``RCx_OPTION`` to the appropriate Relay (1-6) that you had set its pin parameter above."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:166
#: 6d3fd42ee48e448ca637c8f7485bc530
msgid "For example, use Channel 10 to control the switch using Relay 2:"
msgstr ""

